  triage:title "Release guard uses raw spawn_blocking; shutdown drain is unbounded (= RDY-003)" ;
  triage:description "arch-ctm BA-PHASE-REVIEW @ 9f5aef2fe, corroborated independently by solar's BA-READINESS Part A as RDY-003. Finding: the release guard's blocking call uses a raw tokio::task::spawn_blocking instead of the BoundedBlockingBridge pattern; the shutdown drain path has no bound; run_blocking (RBQA-F010) only bounds the waiter side, not this path. Routed to arch-ctm fix/phase-ba-review-2 @ 4e621bb4a (item 3, in progress, same layer as RBQA-F010's bounded-bridge work)." ;
